<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Land buys German hotel.</title>
<headline>DBS Land buys German hotel.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Land Ltd's hotel arm Raffles Holdings has agreed to buy a German hotel for 80 million marks, a company statement said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>It said it had bought the Hotel Vier Jahreszeiten in Hamburg from the Aoki Group of Japan.</p>
<p>DBS said the hotel would retain its name and be managed by Raffles International.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
